Author: noon-at-cgn <75719527+noon-at-cgn@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Thu Oct 8 04:26:58 2026 -0400

    split: decide STRATA_SPLIT_RING before sizing the lend regions; log borrowed vs RAM-kept slots
    
    Builds on #1190. The layer split sized its lend regions (the RAM copies of the experts the prompt path borrows) with
    Prefill::bytes_needed before the split's ring override was applied (Prefill::set_ring_override says it must be set
    before any bytes_needed), so with STRATA_SPLIT_RING=384 the prompt path borrowed 5396 slots and the copy kept 4662.
    The override is now decided first (decide_split_ring); include/strata/program/split_ring.hpp holds the pure helpers
    (split_ring_slots, split_lend_slots - the scan's own tail-slot arithmetic, now one function for the region and the
    borrow), src/program/split_ring_test.cpp covers them on the CPU. A start line reports borrowed vs kept slots and warns
    when kept < borrowed. Docs: MULTI_GPU.md.

